Notice
------

This repository was authored with substantial AI assistance (Anthropic Claude).
The MIT license above covers the source code and project configuration.

Bundled data has its own provenance and licensing — see ATTRIBUTION.md:

- `data/movies.json` is generated from Wikidata, which is CC0 (public
  domain). The MIT grant covers our compiled index of it.
- `data/quotes.json` is generated from English Wikiquote and remains
  licensed under CC BY-SA. The MIT license does NOT relicense it; anyone
  redistributing that file must comply with CC BY-SA (attribution +
  ShareAlike, as documented in ATTRIBUTION.md).

No IMDb data is scraped or redistributed. IMDb identifiers in
`data/movies.json` are used only to build outbound links to public IMDb
pages.
